	<item>
		<title>Wild Caught King Salmon ( Skin On ) 5kg</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-king-salmon-skin-on-5kg/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-king-salmon-skin-on-5kg/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 22 Feb 2025 20:37:38 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=19250</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<h3 data-start="0" data-end="43"><strong>Why Wild-Caught King Salmon is Better</strong></h3>
<p data-start="45" data-end="371">Wild-caught King Salmon is prized for its rich flavor, vibrant color, and superior nutritional profile. Raised in the open ocean, it develops a firmer texture and higher omega-3 content compared to farmed salmon. Free from artificial feeds and antibiotics, wild-caught King Salmon is a healthier and more sustainable choice.</p>
<h4 data-start="373" data-end="427">Benefits of Wild-Caught vs. Farmed King Salmon:</h4>
<ul data-start="428" data-end="774" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-start="428" data-end="501"><strong data-start="430" data-end="464">Richer Flavor &#38; Firmer Texture</strong> – Naturally developed in the wild.</li>
<li data-start="502" data-end="570"><strong data-start="504" data-end="542">No Antibiotics or Artificial Feeds</strong> – 100% natural and clean.</li>
<li data-start="571" data-end="635"><strong data-start="573" data-end="599">Higher Omega-3 Content</strong> – Packed with heart-healthy fats.</li>
<li data-start="636" data-end="705"><strong data-start="638" data-end="661">Sustainably Sourced</strong> – Supports responsible fishing practices.</li>
<li data-start="706" data-end="774" data-is-last-node=""><strong data-start="708" data-end="724">Eco-Friendly</strong> – Lower environmental impact than salmon farming.</li>
</ul>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-king-salmon-skin-on-5kg/">Wild Caught King Salmon ( Skin On ) 5kg</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-king-salmon-skin-on-5kg/">Wild Caught King Salmon ( Skin On ) 5kg</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
