		<item>
		<title>Wild Caught Barramundi ( Skin On ) 5kg</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-barramundi-skin-on-5kg/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-barramundi-skin-on-5kg/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 22 Feb 2025 20:29:27 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=19243</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p data-start="44" data-end="362">Wild-caught Barramundi is superior in flavor, texture, and nutrition. Raised in its natural habitat, it develops a firmer flesh with a clean, ocean-fresh taste. Free from artificial feeds, antibiotics, and overcrowded conditions, wild-caught Barramundi offers a healthier, more sustainable choice for seafood lovers.</p>
<h4 data-start="364" data-end="417">Benefits of Wild-Caught vs. Farmed Barramundi:</h4>
<ul data-start="418" data-end="797" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-start="418" data-end="489"><strong data-start="420" data-end="448">Superior Taste &#38; Texture</strong> – Firmer, cleaner, and more flavorful.</li>
<li data-start="490" data-end="574"><strong data-start="492" data-end="523">No Antibiotics or Chemicals</strong> – Naturally raised without artificial additives.</li>
<li data-start="575" data-end="644"><strong data-start="577" data-end="600">Sustainably Sourced</strong> – Supports responsible fishing practices.</li>
<li data-start="645" data-end="719"><strong data-start="647" data-end="674">Higher Nutrient Content</strong> – Rich in omega-3s and essential vitamins.</li>
<li data-start="720" data-end="797" data-is-last-node=""><strong data-start="722" data-end="738">Eco-Friendly</strong> – Less impact on marine ecosystems than intensive farming.</li>
</ul>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-barramundi-skin-on-5kg/">Wild Caught Barramundi ( Skin On ) 5kg</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-barramundi-skin-on-5kg/">Wild Caught Barramundi ( Skin On ) 5kg</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/wild-caught-barramundi-skin-on-5kg/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
